libc++ (LLVM 18) <sstream>: basic_ostringstream's constructors are dropped
(sstream:901, `basic_ostream<_CharT, _Traits>(&__sb_)' "does not uniquely
resolve"), so a default-constructed std::ostringstream is not good().  Root
cause: cpp_constructor_overload_resolution_with_virtual_base.  clang++ 18
-stdlib=libc++ accepts this program, and it fails only its WRONG assertion.
